[2026-01-30T14:13:01.437Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_019GLvvCW3fWMeCA1R9z7Hbh","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Based on my thorough analysis of all 11 template files:\n\n## Analysis Summary\n\n### Immediate Fixes Found:\n- **Unused Imports**: 0 found - all imports are used\n- **Console Statements (print)**: 0 found\n- **Debug Logging**: 0 found\n- **Any Types**: All `Any` types are appropriately used for `Dict[str, Any]` patterns for dynamic data structures\n\n### Code Quality Observations (Report Only):\n\n**Long Functions (>50 lines):**\n1. `base.py`: The full file is very long (~2000+ lines) with multiple large methods, but individual methods are reasonably sized\n2. `contract.py`: `generate_red_flags_summary()` (~127 lines:271-398), `generate_pricing_analysis()` (~108 lines:400-507)\n3. `legal.py`: `generate_legal_brief()` (~88 lines:245-332), `generate_compliance_assessment()` (~87 lines:334-420)\n4. `understanding.py`: `generate_credibility_report()` (~66 lines:223-306)\n5. `tech_market.py`: `generate_trend_forecast()` (~105 lines:212-316), `generate_vc_briefing()` (~82 lines:318-399)\n6. `financial.py`: `generate_investment_thesis()` (~94 lines:218-311), `generate_kill_criteria()` (~67 lines:354-420)\n7. `investigative.py`: `generate_risk_assessment()` (~96 lines:220-324)\n8. `reputation.py`: `generate_trust_report()` (~77 lines:199-285)\n9. `purchase_decision.py`: `generate_buyer_guide()` (~86 lines:199-289)\n\n**Code Duplication Patterns:**\nThe templates follow a consistent pattern but have significant duplication:\n- All templates have nearly identical import structures\n- All templates define similar `generate_*_report()` methods with repetitive pattern of extracting findings and building markdown sections\n- The `_generate_key_sections()` and `_generate_executive_highlights()` methods follow the same pattern across all templates\n- The ReportHints configuration is similarly structured but with different values\n\nNow let me generate strategic directions based on these observations:"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":286,"cache_read_input_tokens":85593,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":286},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1f794eae-4516-40cc-88e2-7a8e0f0f09e3","uuid":"5f639631-3f90-467e-bc2a-b4d8ca136e59"}
