r classes\\n- `actor/src/templates/due_diligence.py` - Migrate as first template (260 lines to ~80 lines)\\n- All other templates after validation\\n\\n## Success Criteria\\n- [ ] Due diligence template migrated with identical output\\n- [ ] Code reduction of 60%+ in migrated template\\n- [ ] New report variant can be added with <20 lines of declarative config\\n- [ ] No regression in report quality or format\\n\\n## Potential Challenges\\n- Extracted data schemas vary between templates - solved by optional field mapping\\n- Some templates have unique formatting needs - solved by allowing custom renderer override\\n- Output parity verification - create test cases comparing old vs new output\",\"summary\":\"Extract declarative report builder to eliminate 80% duplicated report generation code\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"requirement_id\":null,\"requirement_path\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-01-30T14:13:44.896Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-01-30T14:13:44.896Z\",\"context_id\":null,\"context_name\":\"Research Templates\",\"context_group_id\":\"group_1769727336851_jvk7su8\"}}\r\n  % Total    % Received % Xferd  Average Speed   Time    Time     Time  Current\r\n                                 Dload  Upload   Total   Spent    Left  Speed\r\n\r  0     0   0     0   0     0     0     0  --:--:-- --:--:-- --:--:--     0\r100  6027   0  3105 100  2922 317484 298773  --:--:-- --:--:-- --:--:-- 669666\r","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false}}
