[2026-01-30T14:14:01.343Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_01QLvWKHRTTnCwGRbdsJEBB7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01EmC6qdoNJbRShyM9bEHp1e","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"curl -X POST \"http://localhost:3000/api/directions\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\n  \"project_id\": \"b0c59faa-dddf-4ab1-9308-718ebe3ec829\",\n  \"context_map_id\": \"group_1769727336851_jvk7su8\",\n  \"context_map_title\": \"Research Templates\",\n  \"context_group_id\": \"group_1769727336851_jvk7su8\",\n  \"context_name\": \"Research Templates\",\n  \"source_scan_type\": \"refactor\",\n  \"summary\": \"Add compile-time finding type validation to catch mismatches between config and report methods\",\n  \"direction\": \"## Vision\\nImplement type-safe finding type validation that catches mismatches between template configuration (finding_types in TemplateConfig) and report generation methods at development time rather than runtime.\\n\\n## Business Value\\n- Prevents silent bugs where report methods reference non-existent finding types\\n- Catches typos in finding_type strings across 11 templates with 6-12 types each\\n- Improves IDE autocomplete and developer experience\\n- Reduces debugging time for template authors\\n\\n## Scope\\n**Included:**\\n- Create FindingType enum per template for type-safe references\\n- Add validation decorator to verify finding types in methods match config\\n- Runtime validation during template initialization\\n- Unit tests for validation\\n\\n**Excluded:**\\n- Changing the finding_type storage format in results/database\\n- Modifying the extraction or search systems\\n\\n## Key Components\\n1. `FindingType` enum base class with validation helper methods\\n2. Template-specific enums (e.g., DueDiligenceFindingType, FinancialFindingType)\\n3. `@validates_finding_types` decorator for report methods\\n4. Template.__init__ validation hook\\n\\n## Technical Approach\\n1. Define base protocol for FindingType enums with string conversion\\n2. Generate enums from existing FindingTypeConfig lists:\\n   ```python\\n   class DueDiligenceFindingType(str, Enum):\\n       COMPANY_PROFILE = \\\"company_profile\\\"\\n       FINANCIAL_HEALTH = \\\"financial_health\\\"\\n       LEGAL_HISTORY = \\\"legal_history\\\"\\n       RED_FLAG = \\\"red_flag\\\"\\n       # ...\\n   ```\\n3. Create validator that scans method source for finding_type references\\n4. Run validation in BaseTemplate.__init_subclass__ hook\\n\\n## Files to Modify\\n- `actor/src/templates/base.py` - Add FindingType protocol and validation decorator\\n- `actor/src/templates/due_diligence.py` - Add enum, use in report methods\\n- `actor/src/templates/financial.py` - Add enum, use in report methods\\n- All other template files\\n\\n## Success Criteria\\n- [ ] All templates have FindingType enums matching their config\\n- [ ] Typos in finding_type strings cause test/init failures\\n- [ ] IDE provides autocomplete for finding types\\n- [ ] No runtime behavior changes\\n\\n## Potential Challenges\\n- Backwards compatibility with string-based lookups - solved by making enum inherit from str\\n- Performance of source code scanning - mitigate by caching, only run in debug mode\\n- Dynamic finding types in some edge cases - allow explicit opt-out\"\n}'","description":"Create direction for finding type validation"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1820,"cache_read_input_tokens":88038,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1820},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1f794eae-4516-40cc-88e2-7a8e0f0f09e3","uuid":"e2f03101-01b3-4f02-b9fa-db10c35a8649"}
