\\n       # ...\\n   ```\\n3. Create validator that scans method source for finding_type references\\n4. Run validation in BaseTemplate.__init_subclass__ hook\\n\\n## Files to Modify\\n- `actor/src/templates/base.py` - Add FindingType protocol and validation decorator\\n- `actor/src/templates/due_diligence.py` - Add enum, use in report methods\\n- `actor/src/templates/financial.py` - Add enum, use in report methods\\n- All other template files\\n\\n## Success Criteria\\n- [ ] All templates have FindingType enums matching their config\\n- [ ] Typos in finding_type strings cause test/init failures\\n- [ ] IDE provides autocomplete for finding types\\n- [ ] No runtime behavior changes\\n\\n## Potential Challenges\\n- Backwards compatibility with string-based lookups - solved by making enum inherit from str\\n- Performance of source code scanning - mitigate by caching, only run in debug mode\\n- Dynamic finding types in some edge cases - allow explicit opt-out\",\"summary\":\"Add compile-time finding type validation to catch mismatches between config and report methods\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"requirement_id\":null,\"requirement_path\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-01-30T14:14:02.446Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-01-30T14:14:02.446Z\",\"context_id\":null,\"context_name\":\"Research Templates\",\"context_group_id\":\"group_1769727336851_jvk7su8\"}}\r\n  % Total    % Received % Xferd  Average Speed   Time    Time     Time  Current\r\n                                 Dload  Upload   Total   Spent    Left  Speed\r\n\r  0     0   0     0   0     0     0     0  --:--:-- --:--:-- --:--:--     0\r100  5951   0  3067 100  2884 242815 228327  --:--:-- --:--:-- --:--:-- 495916","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1f794eae-4516-40cc-88e2-7a8e0f0f09e3","uuid":"2c6ce2a7-43e4-4fe7-ae8f-48092457950e","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"{\"success\":true,\"direction\":{\"id\":\"direction_4905cfdd-c0a2-405e-bfff-bf862a3da6fc\",\"project_id\":\"b0c59faa-dddf-4ab1-9308-718ebe3ec